WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.764
Watch and read: While at the market, Ama thinks about this: In “She walked slowly,”

00:00:04.764 --> 00:00:05.981
which word tells how?

00:00:06.783 --> 00:00:10.282
The answer is: slowly. Slowly explains how she walked.

00:00:11.117 --> 00:00:16.464
Watch and read: Kojo is learning with a partner at school. Which word tells how often

00:00:16.464 --> 00:00:17.133
someone reads?

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:20.787
The answer is: often. Often tells frequency.
